Lev adds native recurrent backbones (Ouro and Nanbeige), shared decision heads,
training losses across depths, depth readouts, offline stopping rules and
analysis, data builders, and release packaging and documentation. Release
copies also adapt local paths and remove optional upstream entry points.

Ouro and Nanbeige weights, benchmark and training datasets, and third-party
libraries have their own terms. This source-code license does not relicense
those materials. See docs/LICENSING.md and data/sources.json.
